<title>USA: Chrysler unit files $8 bln shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Chrysler unit files $8 bln shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Financial Corp. filed Friday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $8 billion in asset backed securities.</p>
<p>The shelf offering includes $580 million in previously registered securities.</p>
<p>The securities will represent an ownership interest in a trust consisting of motor vehicle retail installment contracts.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
